From: Gabriel Fernandez <gabriel.fernandez@foss.st.com>
Date: Tue, 5 May 2026 13:31:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 674/913] plat-stm32mp1: let PWR IRQ to propagate to parent GIC

Populate all the API in struct itr_ops to propagate the requests
to the parent interrupt controller (GIC).
The struct itr_ops will be used later.

While there:
- rename gic_hdl with the more generic parent_hdl;
- get parent interrupt controller and interrupt number from DT;
- replace interrupt_alloc_add_handler() with interrupt_create_handler();
- use mask/unmask in interrupt context instead of enable/disable.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 0baa9403c80d5bb5b19070c9ad0755027387b7dd plat-stm32mp1: let PWR IRQ to propagate to parent GIC]
